WEBVTT

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.820
The girl was crying, alone.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:08.250
She'd lost something important to her,

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.490
someone important to her.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.070
If someone had held her,

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.700
if they'd told her she wasn't alone...

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.930
But no one did.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.270
You understand, right?

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.610
Yes.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.970
I have to be a good girl.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:13.640
I cannot damage the name of Kagura Hinata.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:22.170
<b>Third Hour: Hinata</b>

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.490
7:45.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.570
Oh, crap! I'll be late!

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.690
Tacky!

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.520
Uncle!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.170
What's wrong?

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.810
Not bad for your first few days here, kiddo!

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.340
Wait a second, Uncle...

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:48.200
Hinata-chan?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.450
Good morning, Hirose-sama.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.050
I've come to pick you up.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.600
Pick me up?

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.750
Whoo-whoo.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.100
We're drawing pictures today.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.390
I'm glad it's nice out.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:04.850
Y-Yeah.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.520
I guess so.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.730
Hinata-chan, what's wrong?

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.240
Let's go, Hirose-sama!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.170
Uh...

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:16.110
Wh-What should I do?

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.850
I-I wasn't waiting for you, okay?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.470
It's just a coincidence.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:31.520
Want to go to school?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.720
I don't remember saying I would.

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.630
H-Hirose, fancy seeing you here...

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:49.470
M-Morning, Hayami-chan.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:53.340
Hinata-chan came to pick me up, and...

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.330
Let's hurry, Hirose-sama.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.820
Wait, Hinata-chan!

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.110
Wait!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.990
Hayami-chan, you come with us...

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:09.960
Hey!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:10.830
Wait a second—

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:13.480
Let's eat lunch together today, okay?

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.530
But, Hinata-chan...

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.740
It'll be fun, Hirose-sama!

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.610
But, Hinata-chan, Hayami-chan...

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.510
Let's go, Hirose!

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:27.860
K-Kohinata-san!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.320
What are you doing?

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.450
Hirose-sama is going with me.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.460
Too bad.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.790
Hirose promised he'd go to school with me.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.660
Is that true?

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:40.150
Y-Yeah. But, Hayami-chan...

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.630
Hayami-chan, it hurts!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.300
Both of you, get along!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:52.660
Okay, let's start drawing.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:56.340
Your theme is "the sight I find prettiest."

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.780
Don't be late to meet back up.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.210
All right, get going!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:18.360
There's nothing in the village
more beautiful than I am.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.750
I was so surprised this morning!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:25.590
Really! I can't believe you and
Hinata-chan and Kohinata-san

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.400
came to school together!

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:30.410
I was all excited like, "Is it a love triangle?"

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.210
Were you?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.320
Hamaji!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.010
Saying "love triangle" is rude to Hirose.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.190
It's Kohinata!

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.070
Kohinata!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.950
Yeah!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.670
I heard you were walking with Hinata-san,

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.810
and she forced her way in!

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:48.590
Why'd she do that, I wonder.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.030
Because she's a cockroach.

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.340
Hirose-sama!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.970
I got some water for you...

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.960
I'm so sorry!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.040
I'm fine.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.420
What are you doing?

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.020
Hinata-chan, you need to
draw the outline first.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.330
You don't use the paints first.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.710
Oh, yeah. That's right...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.700
Fried egg!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.640
That's right!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.440
Did you make these?

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:39.010
Yes, I tried my best and made them.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.370
Wow, I'm so happy.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.380
These are my favorite.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.530
Yes, I know.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.270
Your uncle told me.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.260
When did you...

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.420
Actually... Then my uncle...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.480
That's why he wouldn't give me a lunch.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.810
"I forgot!" he said.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.960
H-Hirose-sama...

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.080
Say, "Ah..."

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:06.100
No, Hinata-chan! I can eat them myself...

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.040
"Ah..."

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:13.480
O-Okay...

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.320
Well?

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.640
It's good.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.260
These are good!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.790
I'm so glad.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.230
I'm relieved...

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.990
I'm really happy.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:46.180
It was worth burning a hundred eggs.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.610
A-A hundred?

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.050
I shouldn't have said that...

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:59.600
U-Um, it was actually my first time cooking.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.360
I bought a book...

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:05.430
And I stayed up all night
since yesterday... Um...

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.410
You haven't slept?

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.530
N-No.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.120
For me?

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.350
Yes.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.470
Why?

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.740
You're fated to be with me.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:21.180
Hirose-sama, you're fated to be with me.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.920
W-We're out of water.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.120
I'll go get some!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.760
<i>What's wrong with her?</i>

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.960
<i>She's acting strange today.</i>

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:49.730
<i>But yeah, Promised One... Fated person...</i>

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:53.340
<i>A lot of people are calling me stuff.</i>

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.540
It's nice out here.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:21.510
I'm going to sit here alone and draw a picture.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.850
But it's boring to draw alone...

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.150
I know! I'll talk to myself.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.220
Silly.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:42.160
It's sad, not being able to talk
to friends at school.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:45.900
Outside is one thing, but not at school.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:50.550
If they see us together,
they'll come after you, too.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.170
Then what was this morning?

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.520
That was... I just...

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.270
You just?

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.610
A-Anyway, I won't do that anymore!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.030
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:06.320
I think it's nice to have friends.

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:08.980
Someone to help you out when you need it,

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.520
to talk to you,

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.990
to have fun with...

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:20.530
I haven't had many friends
since I became blind.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:46.320
I had one best friend.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:49.380
She said that candy tastes like happiness.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:53.560
She said when you lick it,
flowers bloom in your mouth.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:59.200
And then she left me, too.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.560
Really?

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.780
Where is she now?

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.780
Hirose-sama...

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.140
There you are.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.220
Hayami-chan!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:14.160
Let's head back.

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:16.950
Hayami-chan!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.420
Hayami-chan, wait!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.950
Yui-san drew a picture of herself,

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.850
with fancy clothes she doesn't even own.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.530
Hamaji-san and Maki-san

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.450
are both messing around at the Yakumo store.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:35.170
Oh, I know! Want a candy?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.180
It tastes like happiness.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:41.410
When you lick it,
flowers bloom in your mouth.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:43.350
Here you go!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.740
<i>No way...</i>

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.300
<i>That can't be.</i>

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:05.240
I didn't finish my picture.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.880
It's homework now.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:07.910
This is wonderful!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.510
This is art.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.570
I guess it's because the model's beautiful.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.710
It's supposed to be real.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.890
Hey, Servant A!

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.650
Don't talk back to me! You're a servant!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.000
I'm sorry...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.520
<i>I had one best friend.</i>

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.050
Hirose-sama!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.220
Hirose-sama!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:32.030
Would you come to my house to play?

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.980
You're so bold, Hinata-chan!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.370
She's introducing him to her family already?

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.440
That's not it...

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.670
Hirose-sama?

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:43.860
Sure.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.610
There's something I want to ask you, too.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.350
Okay, I have to talk to the teacher,

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.420
so please wait at the gate for me.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:03.570
<i>Candy tastes like happiness.</i>

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:08.050
<i>When you lick it,
flowers bloom in your mouth.</i>

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.350
Takuma-kun!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.160
That was awful, Takuma-kun!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.180
You dodged my passionate hug.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:26.290
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.090
I guess I'm used to telling when you're around.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:34.330
You must be pretty good, to sense
a spirit's presence...

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.710
What's wrong?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.930
You look down.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.680
Yeah, a little.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.130
Problems with a friend.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.820
You're at a tough age.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:47.260
Okay, I'll use magic to make you feel better!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.830
Magic to make me feel better?

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:49.570
Yep!

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:52.460
<i>Wind and light, sing with me!</i>

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.980
<i>Flowers, dance with me!</i>

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:59.370
<i>All things are one within me!</i>

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.540
Th-That seems kind of impressive.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.160
Stop!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.140
Well?

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:13.230
Amazing, huh?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.480
Y-Yeah... In a lot of ways.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.390
No, it's not a compliment.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:21.310
But you do feel better, right?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.310
Hirose-sama?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.750
I'm here.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:32.410
Oh, Hinata-chan, I'll introduce you...

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.180
Otoha-chan?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.890
What's wrong?

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.060
Her name's Otoha-san?

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:44.630
I think she's a student at our school.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.470
I don't know. I haven't heard her name.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:51.250
Hmm, then...

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.550
You're Hirose Takuma-kun?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.050
That's right.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.600
I've heard about you from Hinata.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.960
You seem to always be taking care
of my granddaughter.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:15.910
Not at all.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:20.900
Hinata-chan... I mean, Kagura-san has
been helping me out quite a bit.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.070
You're here in the village by yourself?
What of your family?

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:28.410
They're in Tokyo.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.460
That must be quite lonely.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:33.630
I hear you're here to recuperate
from some sort of illness?

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:36.400
That's correct. But I'm fine now.

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:39.710
Our class did some drawing today,
and I drew some, too.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.590
That's wonderful to hear.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.230
Well, please stay as long as you'd like.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.710
Hirose-sama, I'll show you inside.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:00.640
Right.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.870
<i>Let's hurry, Hirose-sama.</i>

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.950
<i>Let's head back.</i>

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:28.390
I'll show you my room next.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:30.020
It's separate from the rest of the house.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:33.620
So whenever it rains,
I always love walking through here.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.050
This is my younger sister's... Hotaru's room.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:45.650
Oh, I didn't know you had a sister.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.520
She died.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.950
A long time ago.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.450
Yui-san and the others were really mean!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.830
My... My skirt was...

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.330
But it was okay!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.340
I was wearing bloomers at the time,
so it ended up all right!

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:07.940
Hinata-chan,

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:08.930
Yes?

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:10.410
There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:13.800
Oh, right. You did mention
something like that.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.780
What is it?

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.710
It's about Hayami-chan.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.480
Oh, no. What should I do?

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.490
Hinata-chan.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:28.660
The tea's gotten cold. I should get us refills.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:33.240
Hayami-chan said she had one best friend.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.600
Wasn't that you?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:39.530
Why do you ignore Hayami-chan?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.250
I've heard a lot about the things
going on in the village,

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:47.540
but why do you do it when it's
just me, you, and her?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:52.320
Not only that. But you've been
acting weird today.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:58.590
You said I was fated to be with you...

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.630
It's not weird!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:06.270
You really are fated to be with me!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.590
Why... Why is that?

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.680
I... I...

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.540
It's because that's how I felt.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:20.150
I've felt that way since I first met you.

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:23.680
I've always...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.220
I don't understand.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:29.040
I don't understand what you're thinking.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:33.690
About me... About Hayami-chan...

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.640
Are you really not her friend anymore?

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:41.190
What happened between
you two, Hinata-chan?

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.790
<i>Candy tastes like happiness.</i>

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.600
<i>When you lick it,
flowers bloom in your mouth.</i>

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.830
<i>Don't get so close to Lady Kagura.</i>

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.860
<i>Know your place!</i>

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.830
<i>Get out of this village!</i>

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.410
<i>Hinata-chan!</i>

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.600
<i>Save me, Hinata-chan!</i>

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.560
<i>Hayami-chan!</i>

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.920
<i>Kagura Hinata must be a good girl.</i>

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.020
<i>You cannot damage the
name of Kagura Hinata.</i>

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.230
<i>Hinata-chan!</i>

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.450
<i>Hinata-chan!</i>

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:09.620
<i>Hinata-chan!</i>

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:10.840
<i>Hinata-chan!</i>

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:15.360
Hinata has never been good friends
with Kohinata-san.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:22.300
Then why do you look so sad
about it, Hinata-chan?

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.110
Kohinata-san is a bad girl!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.400
Hinata is a good girl!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:31.310
Kagura Hinata must be a good girl!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.510
She can't be friends with a bad girl!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.810
That's not true.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.850
Hinata-chan isn't like that.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.760
She isn't someone who would
say things like that.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.150
Why...

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.620
Why do you say that?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:48.200
What do you know?

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:52.440
Just a second ago, you said
you didn't understand me.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.030
Why... Why are you...

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.630
Your fried egg...

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.840
It tasted exactly like my mother's.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.270
Your mother's?

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:07.690
My mother, also... A long time ago...

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:14.280
That's why I thought you weren't like that.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:19.160
Don't you actually regret what
happened with Hayami-chan?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.030
If that's the case, I'll help you out.

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:26.600
I don't know much about this village yet, but...

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:27.960
Hirose-sama...

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.340
Can I believe you?

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:42.280
Will you really not betray me, Hirose?

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.030
Don't!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.120
Stop, Hirose-sama!

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.390
Let go!

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:52.050
Let's try talking to Hayami-chan.

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.820
You two can't stay this way!

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:03.350
Hayami-chan, are you okay alone?

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.590
I'm fine.

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:05.860
How do you actually feel?

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:08.240
Everyone can just **** themselves.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:11.300
Th-The preview's just fiction.

00:24:10.580 --> 00:24:15.030
<b>Fourth Hour: Hamaji</b>

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:13.280
It has nothing to do with the actual series!

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:15.000
Everyone can just *** themselves.
